	quests: [
		{
			id: "2DC1691E9DD1CA9F"
			title: "提交一条真正运转的产线"
			icon: "thermal_extra:component_assembly"
			x: 7.6d
			y: 1.1d
			optional: false
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "16CB5D304A96FF31"
					type: "checkmark"
					title: "完成操作"
				}
			]
			description: ["{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/3c57c9becf0091e31569d150.png width:32 height:32 align:center}" "源、能源、物流、机器配置、副产出口均已接好。" "记录起止输入/输出/FE或燃料存量，连续两批。断电或停料测试暂停，恢复后再次完成。截取机器界面与出口。" "可继续并行扩产或向A/交付精确资源。不新增Boss、火箭或五心锁。"]
		}
		{
			id: "64AF7C9457ED0B6A"
			title: "炼油厂双输入与不耗催化剂"
			icon: "immersiveengineering:refinery"
			x: -4.4d
			y: -2.4d
			optional: false
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "4D7F3BCB2688BDE0"
					type: "checkmark"
					title: "完成操作"
				}
			]
			description: [
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/c99d9e3abc5534365074056d.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"FE、所选配方流体与对应催化板。同一工厂可切换多种配方。"
				"锤敲中层重型工程块形成。两侧分别入液、前橙口出液。放相应催化剂并解除红石暂停。"
				"原料消耗、产物增加，催化剂仍在。两种液体不互相误入。"
				"苯酚、乙醛、聚烯烃或裂化支路选实际需要的产品。"
			]
		}
		{
			id: "0D3272D24BE1D820"
			title: "乙醇转乙醛"
			icon: "immersiveengineering:acetaldehyde_bucket"
			x: -1.4d
			y: -2.9d
			optional: false
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "03911CD5B4A05C73"
					type: "checkmark"
					title: "完成操作"
				}
			]
			description: [
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/35df2439a3a5ac09f8a76d15.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/56a6f91362faa8e1c70df3e8.png width:240 height:126 align:center}"
				"8mB乙醇＋铜板催化的路线，或银板路线任选。"
				"选定铜板配方在IE炼油厂转化。核对流体tag和催化槽。"
				"8mB乙醛输出，铜板不消耗。铜板与银板按配方任选一种。"
				"与苯酚制酚醛树脂，或进入轻芳烃。"
			]
		}
		{
			id: "3F09134FA028F978"
			title: "苯与乙烯制苯酚"
			icon: "cmi:phenol_bucket"
			x: -1.4d
			y: 1.1d
			optional: false
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "01489334CBCACEA3"
					type: "checkmark"
					title: "完成操作"
				}
			]
			description: [
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/93d9c3f9142cf048f74b2086.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/6eb6326724e45cc7df3640dc.png width:240 height:126 align:center}"
				"选定配方：苯100mB、乙烯100mB、铁板催化。另有杂酚油分馏来源。"
				"两侧输入苯与液态乙烯，铁板放催化槽，供能收集200mB苯酚。"
				"两液体实际各减100，铁板保留。乙烯在此是Forge流体。"
				"苯酚送酚醛树脂，乙烯来源可从石脑油分馏选取。"
			]
		}
		{
			id: "065247900F77B19B"
			title: "合成酚醛树脂"
			icon: "immersiveengineering:phenolic_resin_bucket"
			x: 1.6d
