					title: "完成操作"
				}
			]
			description: [
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/c2f2b9dbab4690c9ad42d1e1.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/c4070f10377ce77eb3cc5314.png width:240 height:126 align:center}"
				"苯酚100mB＋乙醛100mB，铜板为不消耗催化剂。"
				"炼油厂双输入供料，保持催化剂和供电，输出200mB树脂。"
				"树脂罐增200mB且两输入减少。"
				"灌装形成工程塑胶，按用途查询选择实际制品。"
			]
		}
