			description: [
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/5736066a8b9be3a43c3c1ed0.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/16dac54148bdaa05154fe4e1.png width:240 height:98 align:center}"
				"1000mB聚烯烃、符合multi_use/plate的铸模、急速冷冻机与FE。"
				"供液并放板铸模，按8000能量配方加工。多用铸模不消耗。"
				"1聚烯烃板输出，铸模保留。多个合格铸模是槽内任选一种。"
			]
