				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/ffc8db9149d9563056b6da31.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/98f0b51e4834c39565052b83.png width:240 height:98 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/0d6e18316891e70c759af5c1.png width:240 height:98 align:center}"
				"石脑油100mB。普通任选一种高级精炼。此配方查询类型为Forge fluid。"
				"普通机出苯50mB＋乙烯50mB。高级机出苯50mB＋乙烯100mB，分罐导出。"
				"正确流体与数量入罐。使用兼容流体的储罐与管道。"
				"苯与乙烯可回IE化工。确认流体→化学品转换后才接化学机器。"
			]
